@startuml
title CancellationIntent - CR-CAN-003 (REVIEW implementation)
[*] --> PENDING : TxA validates and commits intent
PENDING --> ACCEPTED : TxB after confirmed TxA commit
PENDING --> REJECTED : receipt >= observedCoverageEnd
PENDING --> REJECTED : root version conflict
ACCEPTED --> ACCEPTED : same requestId replay after lost response
REJECTED --> REJECTED : same requestId replay, no retargeting
note right of PENDING
 Temporarily blocks renewal and manual extension.
 TxB coordinates slot/request and takes DB receiptCheckedAt.
 Accept only same observedVersion and receipt < observedCoverageEnd.
 Commit unknown => lookup/recovery; never infer rollback.
 Recovery obtains receipt now; no fabricated early acceptance.
end note
note right of ACCEPTED
 Intent and operation SUCCEEDED commit together in TxB.
 TxB commit may cross deadline; earlier valid receipt still applies.
 Root PENDING_CANCEL, effective at end of ALL prepaid coverage.
 HTTP response loss never converts stored accepted outcome to failure.
end note
note right of REJECTED
 TOO_LATE or version conflict; operation FAILED.
 Release pending guard, preserve history.
 No automatic new-cycle retarget or refund.
end note
@enduml
